      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The island’s marina remains a key feature, offering boating access to San Diego Bay and nearby beaches.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitcalifornia.com/experience/what-do-shelter-island-san-diego/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Shelter Island’s evolution from a tidal sandbar to a developed community mirrors San Diego’s mid‑20th century waterfront expansion.",
